e></div></div></section><section class=\"sc-section sc-white\" id=\"club-vs-challenge\"><div class=\"sc-wrap\"><div class=\"sc-intro\"><span class=\"sc-eyebrow\">Choose your way forward</span><h2>Club or Challenge?</h2><p>Start with your goal. Then choose how you want to work toward it.</p></div><div class=\"sc-grid sc-grid-2\"><article class=\"sc-card\"><h3>Club: build your approach</h3><p>Practical guidance, marketing ideas, and tools to help you decide what to try for your business. Work through the opportunities at your own pace.</p></article><article class=\"sc-card\"><h3>Challenge: put it into action</h3><p>A focused attempt with a defined goal, actions to try, and progress to review. The $1K Challenge is planned around 30 days.</p></article></div><div class=\"sc-note\"><p>All six Club and Challenge offers are coming soon. They are separate offers; access, requirements, and final inclusions will be confirmed before enrollment opens.</p></div></div></section></div>",
